{"id":"6a4ad5688aac17fe","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md","title":"每个有限标准层内部不可定义全部本层真理","display":"thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy — 每个有限标准层内部不可定义全部本层真理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy","aliases":["91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy","91-thm-definability-hierarchy","91-thm-truth-definability-levels"],"display":"thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy — 每个有限标准层内部不可定义全部本层真理","depends_on":["[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy</span><span>91-thm-definability-hierarchy</span><span>91-thm-truth-definability-levels</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy — 每个有限标准层内部不可定义全部本层真理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8f93c57db760a2b7\" href=\"?note=8f93c57db760a2b7\" title=\"91-df-hierarchical-truth\">91-df-hierarchical-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_n=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_i:i&lt;n\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_n=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_i:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0=\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathfrak M_0=\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{n+1}=\\mathfrak M_n[T_n\\mapsto\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_n)]\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{n+1}=\\mathfrak M_n[T_n\\mapsto\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_n)]\\)</span>，扩张公式语法均可有效编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M_n}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_n)\\)</span> 采用上游定理；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TB}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{TB}_n\\)</span> 是固定 T_n 对 L_n 的逐句双条件集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}definability\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M_n}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_n)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}definability\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M_n}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_n)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{n+1}\\models\\operatorname{TB}_n,\\qquad\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\ [\\operatorname{TB}_n\\vdash T_n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_{n+1}\\models\\operatorname{TB}_n,\\qquad\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\ [\\operatorname{TB}_n\\vdash T_n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一项逐层代入标准扩张 Tarski 定理；第二项分别是按外延定义的语义正确性及公理实例可证性。\n原稿的 True_Ln 没有指定较低 T 符号的解释，不能仅从语言名确定真句集。现在明确递归标准结构；其全外延是元层定义，内部不可定义性没有被更高层新增符号推翻。</p>\n<p>来源：Chapter 9 的分层真理；Chapter 3 与 Theorem 7.4 的对角限制；有限标准层递归为本地展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-hierarchical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"8f93c57db760a2b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-hierarchical-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_n=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T_i:i<n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_0=\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{n+1}=\\mathfrak M_n[T_n\\mapsto\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_n)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TB}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}definability\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathfrak M_n}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}(\\mathfrak M_n)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_{n+1}\\models\\operatorname{TB}_n,\\qquad\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_n}\\ [\\operatorname{TB}_n\\vdash T_n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi].","display":true}],"bytes":1894,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91